flowchart LR
  Auth[Existing ProtectedRoute] --> Route{editor=v3?}
  Route -->|no| Legacy[Existing EditorLayout]
  Route -->|yes| Shell[V3Editor shell]
  Shell --> Session[useV3DesignSession]
  Shell --> Viewport[V3Canvas and V3TextInspector]
  Session --> Controller[v3DesignSession pure revision and request controller]
  Session --> API[Existing designsApi GET / PUT / POST]
  API --> Nest[Existing NestJS designs endpoints]
  Session --> Serialization[Existing captureCanvasData / restoreCanvasData]
  Serialization --> Store[Existing useCanvasStore]
  Viewport --> Store
  Viewport --> Elements[Existing canvas element components]
  Shell --> Export[Existing downloadCanvas PNG]
  Export --> Store
